{% comment %}
  Harvey's Coffee — Subscription Quiz v23
  Trade Coffee style click-through

  v23 changes (2026-09-14) - STICKER TEXT.
    - Sale sticker text bigger (11 -> 13px desktop, 9 -> 11px mobile);
      the circle grew with it (100px / 82px) so the text still fits.

  v22 changes (2026-09-14) - MOBILE QUIZ CENTERING + FOOTER + IMAGE.
    - Mobile quiz wrapper extends 120px past the viewport (container
      bottom padding rebalances the flex centering), so the theme
      footer stays below the fold while the card sits at the visual
      middle of the screen. Mobile cards slightly bigger.
    - Mobile step scroll: cards that fit the screen are CENTERED again
      (Q1, frequency); taller-than-screen cards keep the progress-bar
      anchor from v20 so there is no weird jump. Get Started lands
      centered on question one via the same logic.
    - Build Your Plan circle photo enlarged: 250 -> 300px desktop,
      110 -> 175px mobile, sticker scaled up to match.

  v21 changes (2026-09-14) - AUDIT FIXES.
    - Progress bar now shows a 5th segment on the Ground path, so the
      bar matches the "Step x of 5" label instead of showing a full bar
      on both of the last two steps.
    - "Need More?" panel max-height 500 -> 1400px: 500 clipped the
      bottom of the Triple card (and any extra_bag blocks). The value
      only drives the open/close animation.
    - Removed dead CSS from the deleted hero (.cq-hero-img-wrap,
      .cq-hero-content) and two unused Customizer settings
      (two_bags_badge, summary_title). Refreshed stale comments that
      still described pre-v18 behavior.

  v20 changes (2026-09-14) - CTA ARROW + MOBILE SCROLL FIX.
    - Get Started arrow nudges right on a 1.2s loop (reduced-motion
      safe) so the button reads as tappable.
    - Mobile step scroll fixed: the centering math was aiming a
      taller-than-screen card at mid-viewport, which scrolled past the
      progress bar after question one. Phones (<=600px) now always
      anchor to the progress bar at the top; desktop keeps centering.

  v19 changes (2026-09-14) - MOBILE COMPACTION.
    - Press strip back ABOVE Build Your Plan on mobile (v17's order
      swap removed; natural DOM order everywhere).
    - Mobile warm-up shrunk across the board (smaller press padding,
      heading 22, circle photo 110px, tighter list, smaller icons and
      sticker) so logos + plan card + Get Started fit one phone screen
      with no scrolling.
    - Step buttons slightly smaller on mobile (15px / tighter padding)
      so "Continue to Checkout" sits comfortably.

  v18 changes (2026-09-14) - FULL-SCREEN QUIZ TAKEOVER.
    - Clicking Get Started now HIDES the whole warm-up (press strip +
      Build Your Plan) and the quiz takes over: .cq-quiz-flow.cq-active
      is a flex column with justify-content:center over min-height
      100vh, so each question card sits vertically centered; the page
      scrolls to the top on the swap. Warm-up and quiz are never both
      on screen.
    - The warm-up stays hidden for the rest of the session, including
      Back to step 1 (the old re-show in go() is removed).
    - Container bottom padding 80 -> 40 for truer centering.

  v17 changes (2026-09-14) - MOBILE ORDER + QUIZ CENTERING.
    - Mobile only: the Build Your Plan card now renders ABOVE the
      Recommended By strip (flex order swap inside .cq-hero-section;
      DOM order unchanged, desktop unchanged).
    - Step navigation now centers the active question card vertically
      in the viewport (cqScrollToStep) instead of pinning the progress
      bar to the top, which left every card sitting high on desktop and
      question one high on mobile. Cards taller than the viewport align
      to the top with 64px headroom instead, so nothing is cut off.

  v16 changes (2026-09-14) - HERO REMOVED, MOBILE COMPACTED.
    - The photo hero banner is gone (markup, CSS, and its five schema
      settings: hero_image, hero_overlay, hero_text_color, warmup_badge,
      hero_title, hero_subtitle). The warm-up now opens directly on the
      Recommended By strip, then the Build Your Plan card, then the CTA.
      The announcement bar carries the offer.
    - CTA default renamed "Start the Quiz" -> "Get Started". If the old
      label was SAVED in the Customizer it must be retyped there.
    - Mobile spacing compacted (smaller circle photo, tighter card and
      list, full-width CTA) so the whole warm-up including the button
      fits in the first screen or one short swipe.
    - The quiz still reveals on CTA click and scrolls to step 1.

  v15 changes (2026-09-14) - CHECKOUT SPEED ONLY. Same cart semantics.
    - The click was paying for: iframe setup + POST /cart/clear.js +
      POST /cart/add.js in sequence. Now a primer at page load (and on
      every bfcache restore) builds the pristine iframe ahead of time
      and GETs /cart.js; when the cart is already empty - the common
      case for quiz traffic - the clear round trip is skipped entirely.
      Unknown or non-empty cart still clears first, exactly as before,
      and the cached count is consumed per attempt so a failed attempt
      (item now in cart) can never skip the clear on retry. Back from
      checkout re-primes, sees the item, and clears correctly.
    - The button swaps to "One moment…" instantly on click (restored on
      error / Back), so the wait reads as progress instead of a dead
      button.

  v14 changes (2026-09-14) - CHECKOUT BUTTON FIX ONLY.
    - Coming BACK from checkout left "Continue to Checkout" permanently
      grayed out: the click locks the button (dataset.busy + cq-busy)
      against double-submits, the page navigates to checkout on success,
      and the browser then restores this page from the back-forward
      cache as a frozen snapshot with the lock still on. A pageshow
      listener now unlocks the button and stops the overlay guard on
      every show, so Back -> change an answer -> checkout again works.

  v13 changes (2026-09-14) - IMAGE CROPS, HERO LEGIBILITY, MOBILE.
    - Plan-card circle enforced by the wrapper (aspect-ratio square,
      image pinned absolute inside), so portrait uploads can no longer
      stretch it into an oval or overflow the card.
    - Hero headline/subheading: fluid clamp sizing, balanced wrapping,
      white glow for legibility on busy photos; default overlay 35%.
    - Mobile: shorter hero, stacked plan card with the photo on top,
      full-width CTA.

  v12 changes (2026-09-14) - WARM-UP FLOW + TYPE SCALE ONLY. No pricing,
  no cart logic, no variant/selling-plan changes.
    - The quiz now starts HIDDEN. The page shows only the warm-up (hero,
      press strip, Build Your Plan). cqStart() adds cq-active to #cqFlow
      and scrolls to step 1. All quiz elements are still in the DOM on
      load, so initDefaults() pre-selects as before.
    - ONE CTA: the hero button is gone (hero_cta setting removed); the
      single Start the Quiz button sits under the Build Your Plan card,
      after the education has done its work.
    - Type scale bumped throughout: hero 58/20, plan heading 34,
      includes 22/16, warm CTA 18px with bigger padding, question titles
      27, subtitles 16, option names 17, Next buttons 17, Back 16,
      trust badges 15, press heading 15, matching mobile bumps.

  v11 changes (2026-09-14) - WARM-UP LAYOUT ONLY. No pricing, no cart
  logic, no variant/selling-plan changes, no changes to any quiz step.
    - Warm-up rebuilt to match Atlas's landing order exactly:
        1. Full-width photo hero (Customizer image, white-overlay
           strength slider, text color, headline, subheading, button).
           hero_title default is now "Fall Sale"; rename per sale. If a
           value like "Find Your Dream Cup" was saved in the Customizer
           it will still show until changed there.
        2. "RECOMMENDED BY" press strip: the store's existing As Seen On
           section embedded verbatim (same CDN SVGs, same height-based
           --logo-h sizing, one line at every width), on a white band.
           Its CSS is prefixed with .coffee-quiz so it outranks the
           section's * reset.
        3. "Build Your Plan" card: heading + box photo + sticker +
           "Each Shipment Includes" list + Start the Quiz button.
        4. The quiz, unchanged.
    - Removed the v10 press-logo image pickers (press_logo_1..3,
      press_title); the strip is hardcoded like the standalone section.
    - warmup_badge no longer has a default: the pill is hidden unless
      text is entered, since the hero headline and the announcement bar
      already carry the offer.
    - Everything still sits inside .cq-hero-section, so it hides after
      step 1 and returns when the customer navigates back.

  v10 changes (2026-09-14) - WARM-UP SECTION ONLY. No pricing, no cart
  logic, no variant/selling-plan changes, no changes to any quiz step.
    - Added an Atlas-style warm-up block ABOVE question one: offer badge,
      headline, "Each shipment includes" list with the box photo and a
      FREE BAG sticker, a Start the Quiz button, reassurance line, and an
      optional "Recommended by" press-logo row.
    - The warm-up uses the existing .cq-hero-section class. go() already
      hides that class on every step after 1 and shows it again on step 1
      (that hook was dead code until now), so the warm-up vanishes once
      the customer starts answering and returns if they navigate back.
      Zero new step logic.
    - The old hero title/subtitle markup inside the Q1 card is removed;
      hero_title and hero_subtitle now render in the warm-up instead.
      (Same setting ids, so any values saved in the Customizer carry
      over.) Note the Q1 card previously hid that hero on mobile via the
      .cq-hero-content media rule; the warm-up is visible on mobile.
    - Start the Quiz smooth-scrolls to the progress bar. The quiz stays
      fully rendered below the warm-up, Atlas-style: no page change, no
      gate, question one is one scroll away with defaults pre-selected.
    - New settings under "Warm-Up (above quiz)". All ids are NEW except
      hero_title/hero_subtitle, so their defaults apply immediately even
      on a store where the section was saved before.

  !! IMPORTANT AFTER UPLOAD !!
  Liquid `default:` values and schema defaults only apply to settings
  that have never been saved in the Customizer. hero_title and
  hero_subtitle keep whatever is saved. Everything else in the warm-up is
  new and will show its default until you edit it. Upload the box photo
  into "Warm-up image" and the press logos, or those spots render a
  placeholder / stay hidden respectively.

  v9 changes (2026-09-08) — OFFER LABELLING ONLY. No pricing, no cart
  logic, no variant/selling-plan changes.
    - The store was ALREADY giving a free bag on the Double ($32 -> $16
      via FIRSTORDER is exactly one of two bags free) but labelling it
      "Get $16 Off". Ads promised a free bag, the quiz said discount, and
      customers concluded the offer had changed. Relabelled to match what
      the code already does.
        Double: "Get $16 Off"      -> "1ST BAG FREE"
        Triple: "Get $23.75 Off"   -> "1½ BAGS FREE"
        Single: "Get $8.75 Off"    -> "50% OFF"        (kept as a discount
          on purpose — if every card says FREE the Double loses its pull)
    - FIXED A FALSE CLAIM: savings_three_bags read "+ Always save 50%".
      Triple is $47.50 vs $64.50 retail = 26%, not 50%. Double read 24%;
      also 26%. Both replaced with the actual per-shipment price, which is
      the more useful number anyway.
    - Bag counts added to the descriptions so "1st bag free" has an
      obvious referent.
    - New .cq-pr-free chip style for the free-bag callout.

  v8 changes (2026-09-08):
    - Removed the full-screen "Taking you to checkout" cover (Harvey
      wanted it gone). The pristine-fetch isolation from v7 is what
      actually stops the popup; the cover was belt-and-suspenders.
    - Replaced it with an invisible guard: from click until the page
      navigates, any fixed/sticky element that was NOT visible at click
      time and becomes visible is hidden. Quiz elements are exempt. Stops
      on navigation or on error. Zero visual change on the page.
    - Button dims slightly while the cart calls run.

  v7 changes (2026-09-08):
    - Cart popup on "Continue to Checkout" fixed three ways, so it no
      longer depends on guessing which element the theme/app pops:
        1. The two cart calls go through a PRISTINE fetch taken from a
           same-origin iframe. Theme/app scripts that monkey-patch
           window.fetch or XMLHttpRequest to open a cart UI on
           /cart/add.js never see the request.
        2. The instant the button is clicked, a full-screen "Taking you
           to checkout" cover opens as a top-layer <dialog>. Anything
           that pops underneath it is invisible. It is removed only on
           error (page navigates away on success).
        3. Dawn's actual cart elements (theme is Dawn, cart_type =
           notification) are hidden by CSS scoped to body.cq-hide-cart:
           <cart-notification>, #cart-notification, <cart-drawer>,
           #CartDrawer.
    - Removed the v6 MutationObserver; the cover makes it unnecessary.

  v6 changes (2026-09-08):
    - Re-added cart drawer suppression, which the v5 rewrite dropped.

  v5 changes (2026-09-07):
    - Checkout now uses /cart/add.js with selling_plan instead of a cart
      permalink. Permalinks were silently dropping ?selling_plan= and
      creating one-time orders.
    - Hard-fail if no selling plan ID resolves, instead of degrading
      silently to a one-time purchase.
    - single_bag 4_weeks plan ID updated to 27403878434.
    - Removed unused CFG.pricing block (nothing read it, and its figures
      had drifted from the section settings).
{% endcomment %}

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;900&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

.coffee-quiz{
  --cq-cream:{{ section.settings.color_background | default: '#FAF3E8' }};
  --cq-espresso:{{ section.settings.color_text | default: '#2C1810' }};
  --cq-amber:{{ section.settings.color_accent | default: '#D4920B' }};
  --cq-amber-light:#F5C842;
  --cq-spice:#8B4513;
  --cq-sage:{{ section.settings.color_success | default: '#3D5A3E' }};
  --cq-white:#FFFFFF;
  --cq-border:#E0D5C7;
  --cq-muted:#7A6E63;
  --cq-red:#B8342E;
  --cq-font-display:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;
  --cq-font-body:'DM Sans',-apple-system,sans-serif;
  --cq-radius:12px;
  --cq-shadow:0 2px 16px rgba(44,24,16,0.08);
  --cq-shadow-hover:0 4px 24px rgba(44,24,16,0.14);
  --cq-transition:0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
}
.coffee-quiz *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
.coffee-quiz{font-family:var(--cq-font-body);color:var(--cq-espresso);background:var(--cq-cream);line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}

/* ══════ WARM-UP (press strip + plan card above Q1) ══════
   Hidden for good by cqStart() when the customer clicks Get Started;
   the quiz then owns the screen. */
.cq-hero-section{background:var(--cq-cream)}
.cq-warm{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 20px 4px;text-align:center}
.cq-warm-heading{font-family:var(--cq-font-display);font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,34px);font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:24px;text-wrap:balance}
.cq-warm-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;gap:28px;align-items:center;text-align:left;background:var(--cq-white);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--cq-shadow);padding:28px 30px}
/* The wrapper owns the square (aspect-ratio) and the image is pinned
   absolutely inside it, so a portrait or landscape upload can never
   stretch the circle into an oval or overflow the card - theme img
   rules (height:auto etc.) have nothing to override. The sticker sits
   above on z-index 2. */
.cq-warm-img-wrap{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:300px;margin:0 auto;aspect-ratio:1}
.cq-warm-img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.cq-warm-img-ph{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#d4a574,#8B6914);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);box-shadow:inset 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)}
.cq-warm-sticker{position:absolute;top:-10px;left:-14px;width:100px;height:100px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cq-amber-light);color:var(--cq-espresso);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.25;padding:10px;transform:rotate(-12deg);box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);z-index:2}
.cq-warm-inc-title{font-family:var(--cq-font-display);font-size:22px;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:16px}
.cq-warm-inc{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
.cq-warm-inc li{display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45}
.cq-warm-ic{flex:0 0 38px;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cq-sage);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.cq-warm-ic svg{width:19px;height:19px;stroke:#fff;fill:none;stroke-width:2}
.cq-warm-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;margin-top:28px;padding:19px 54px;background:var(--cq-amber);color:var(--cq-espresso);font-family:var(--cq-font-body);font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-transform:uppercase;border:none;border-radius:60px;cursor:pointer;transition:all var(--cq-transition)}
.cq-warm-cta:hover{background:var(--cq-amber-light);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(212,146,11,0.3)}
/* v20 - the arrow nudges right on a loop so the button reads as "tap
   me". Respects reduced-motion. */
.cq-warm-cta svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2.5;animation:cqArrowNudge 1.2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes cqArrowNudge{0%,100%{transform:translateX(0)}50%{transform:translateX(6px)}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.cq-warm-cta svg{animation:none}}
.cq-warm-reassure{font-size:15px;color:var(--cq-muted);margin-top:12px}

/* As Seen On strip - the store's existing section, embedded on a white
   band like Atlas. Height-based sizing per logo via --logo-h so the
   three wordmarks read as equal optical weight; the row scales as a
   unit via its font-size and never wraps. Prefixed with .coffee-quiz to
   outrank the section's own * reset. */
.coffee-quiz .as-seen-on{padding:32px 16px;background:var(--cq-white)}
.coffee-quiz .as-seen-on__container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}
.coffee-quiz .as-seen-on__title{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:#2C1A0E;margin:0 0 24px 0;font-weight:600}
.coffee-quiz .as-seen-on__logos{font-size:clamp(0.28rem,1.816vw - 0.29px,1rem);display:flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:3em;width:100%}
.coffee-quiz .as-seen-on__logos img{flex:0 0 auto;height:calc(var(--logo-h) * 1em / 16);width:auto;max-width:none;object-fit:contain}
@media screen and (max-width:480px){
  .coffee-quiz .as-seen-on{padding:24px 8px}
}

@media(max-width:600px){
  /* Mobile (v19): press strip back on top (natural DOM order), and the
     whole warm-up compacted so logos + plan card + Get Started all fit
     in one phone screen with no scrolling. */
  .coffee-quiz .as-seen-on{padding:12px 8px}
  .coffee-quiz .as-seen-on__title{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .cq-warm{padding-top:10px}
  .cq-warm-heading{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .cq-warm-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:12px 14px;gap:10px}
  .cq-warm-img-wrap{max-width:175px}
  .cq-warm-sticker{width:82px;height:82px;font-size:11px;top:-8px;left:-10px;padding:8px}
  .cq-warm-inc{gap:8px}
  .cq-warm-inc li{font-size:13px;text-align:left;gap:10px}
  .cq-warm-ic{flex:0 0 30px;width:30px;height:30px}
  .cq-warm-ic svg{width:15px;height:15px}
  .cq-warm-inc-title{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:8px}
  .cq-warm-cta{width:100%;margin-top:12px;padding:15px 20px;font-size:16px}
  .cq-warm-reassure{margin-top:6px;font-size:13px}
  /* Slightly smaller step buttons so "Continue to Checkout" fits
     comfortably on a phone. */
  .cq-next{font-size:15px;padding:14px 26px}
}

/* ══════ QUIZ FLOW ══════
   v18: once revealed, the quiz owns the whole screen (the warm-up is
   hidden by cqStart) and flex-centers itself vertically, so a short
   question card sits mid-viewport instead of hanging at the top. */
.cq-quiz-flow{display:none;background:var(--cq-cream);min-height:100vh}
.cq-quiz-flow.cq-active{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}

.cq-progress-bar{max-width:500px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 24px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.cq-prog-seg{flex:1;height:4px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--cq-border);transition:background 0.4s ease}
.cq-prog-seg.cq-done{background:var(--cq-amber)}
.cq-prog-text{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--cq-muted);white-space:nowrap;min-width:55px;text-align:right}

.cq-container{max-width:640px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px 40px}

.cq-step{display:none;animation:cqSlideIn 0.3s ease both}
.cq-step.cq-active{display:block}
@keyframes cqSlideIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(30px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0)}}
@keyframes cqSlideBack{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0)}}
.cq-step.cq-back{animation:cqSlideBack 0.3s ease both}

.cq-q-card{background:var(--cq-white);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--cq-shadow-hover);padding:40px 32px;margin-top:24px}
.cq-q-title{font-family:var(--cq-font-display);font-size:27px;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:6px}
.cq-q-sub{font-size:16px;color:var(--cq-muted);text-align:center;margin-bottom:28px}

/* ══════ OPTION CARDS ══════ */
.cq-opts{display:grid;gap:12px}
.cq-opts.cq-g2{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
.cq-opts.cq-g3{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr}

.cq-opt{position:relative;background:var(--cq-white);border:2px solid var(--cq-border);border-radius:var(--cq-radius);padding:22px 16px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:all var(--cq-transition);user-select:none}
.cq-opt:hover{border-color:var(--cq-spice);box-shadow:var(--cq-shadow);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.cq-opt.cq-on{border-color:var(--cq-amber);background:linear-gradient(to bottom,#FFFDF7,var(--cq-white));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(212,146,11,0.15),var(--cq-shadow)}

.cq-opt-img{width:100%;max-width:100px;height:80px;object-fit:contain;margin:0 auto 10px;display:block}
.cq-opt-img-ph{width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#d4a574,#8B6914);margin:0 auto 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);box-shadow:inset 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)}
.cq-opt-name{font-weight:700;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:3px}
.cq-opt-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--cq-muted);line-height:1.4}

/* Radio */
.cq-dot-wrap{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--cq-border);margin:10px auto 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:all var(--cq-transition)}
.cq-opt.cq-on .cq-dot-wrap{border-color:var(--cq-amber);background:var(--cq-amber)}
.cq-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:white;opacity:0;transition:opacity var(--cq-transition)}
.cq-opt.cq-on .cq-dot{opacity:1}

/* Badge */
.cq-badge{position:absolute;top:-11px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--cq-sage);color:white;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 14px;border-radius:100px;white-space:nowrap}

/* Pricing in bag cards */
.cq-price-row{margin-top:14px;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:center;gap:6px}
.cq-pr-old{font-size:18px;color:var(--cq-muted);text-decoration:line-through}
.cq-pr-new{font-size:36px;font-family:var(--cq-font-display);font-weight:900;color:var(--cq-red)}
.cq-pr-off{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--cq-red);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-top:6px}
.cq-pr-save{font-size:12px;color:var(--cq-sage);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.3px;margin-top:4px}

/* v9 — free-bag callout chip. Applied only to tiers where the first
   order genuinely includes a free bag (Double, Triple). The Single keeps
   the plain discount treatment so the contrast stays visible. */
.cq-pr-off.cq-pr-free{
  display:inline-block;
  background:var(--cq-red);
  color:#fff;
  padding:5px 14px;
  border-radius:100px;
  letter-spacing:1px;
  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.2;
  white-space:nowrap;
}

/* Bag card image - larger for bag step */
.cq-bag-img{width:100%;max-width:140px;height:160px;object-fit:contain;margin:0 auto 14px;display:block}
.cq-bag-img-ph{width:100px;height:140px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#d4a574,#8B6914);margin:0 auto 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);box-shadow:inset 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);position:relative}
.cq-bag-img, .cq-ribbon-wrap, .cq-ribbon-wrap img, .cq-bag-img-ph{border-radius:12px !important;overflow:hidden !important}

/* Sale ribbon - diagonal like Atlas */
.cq-ribbon-wrap{position:relative;display:inline-block;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}
.cq-ribbon{position:absolute;top:12px;right:-12px;background:var(--cq-amber-light);color:var(--cq-espresso);font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 20px;transform:rotate(25deg);z-index:3;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)}
.cq-ribbon::before,.cq-ribbon::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-4px;border:4px solid transparent}
.cq-ribbon::before{left:0;border-top-color:#c8920a;border-left-color:#c8920a}
.cq-ribbon::after{right:0;border-top-color:#c8920a;border-right-color:#c8920a}

/* Most Popular badge - Atlas circle style */
.cq-popular{position:absolute;top:-14px;left:-14px;width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cq-sage);color:white;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:0.3px;z-index:2;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)}

/* Bag cards equal height */
.cq-bag-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.cq-bag-grid .cq-opt{padding:30px 12px 18px;overflow:visible}

/* Frequency cards */
.cq-freq{position:relative;background:var(--cq-white);border:2px solid var(--cq-border);border-radius:var(--cq-radius);padding:28px 18px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:all var(--cq-transition);user-select:none}
.cq-freq:hover{border-color:var(--cq-spice);box-shadow:var(--cq-shadow)}
.cq-freq.cq-on{border-color:var(--cq-amber);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(212,146,11,0.15),var(--cq-shadow)}
.cq-freq.cq-on .cq-dot-wrap{border-color:var(--cq-amber);background:var(--cq-amber)}
.cq-freq.cq-on .cq-dot{opacity:1}
.cq-freq-ev{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--cq-muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}
.cq-freq-num{font-family:var(--cq-font-display);font-size:52px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.1;color:var(--cq-espresso)}
.cq-freq-u{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:var(--cq-espresso)}
.cq-freq .cq-dot-wrap{margin:10px auto 0}

/* Need More */
.cq-more-btn{text-align:center;margin-top:20px;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--cq-espresso);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;user-select:none;transition:color var(--cq-transition)}
.cq-more-btn:hover{color:var(--cq-amber)}
.cq-more-btn svg{width:14px;height:14px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2.5;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:4px;transition:transform 0.3s ease}
.cq-more-btn.cq-open svg{transform:rotate(180deg)}
.cq-more-panel{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height 0.4s ease,opacity 0.3s ease;opacity:0}
/* v21 - 500px clipped the bottom of the Triple card (and any extra_bag
   blocks); the cap only drives the animation, so give it headroom. */
.cq-more-panel.cq-show{max-height:1400px;opacity:1;margin-top:16px}

/* Nav */
.cq-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:28px}
.cq-back{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:12px 20px;background:transparent;color:var(--cq-muted);font-family:var(--cq-font-body);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border:none;cursor:pointer;transition:color var(--cq-transition)}
.cq-back:hover{color:var(--cq-espresso)}
.cq-back svg{width:14px;height:14px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2.5}
.cq-next{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:16px 42px;background:var(--cq-amber);color:var(--cq-espresso);font-family:var(--cq-font-body);font-size:17px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;border:none;border-radius:60px;cursor:pointer;transition:all var(--cq-transition);margin-left:auto;opacity:0.35;pointer-events:none}
.cq-next.cq-go{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.cq-next.cq-go:hover{background:var(--cq-amber-light);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(212,146,11,0.3)}
.cq-next svg{width:16px;height:16px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2.5}

/* ══════ ORDER SUMMARY ══════ */
.cq-sum-rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-bottom:20px}
.cq-sum-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cq-border);font-size:15px}
.cq-sum-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.cq-sum-lbl{color:var(--cq-muted);font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:600}
.cq-sum-val{font-weight:700;text-align:right}
.cq-sum-div{height:1px;background:var(--cq-espresso);margin:4px 0 16px;opacity:0.15}
.cq-sum-price{margin:0 0 24px;text-align:center}
.cq-sum-price-lbl{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--cq-muted);margin-bottom:4px}
.cq-sum-old{font-size:18px;text-decoration:line-through;color:var(--cq-muted);margin-right:8px}
.cq-sum-new{font-family:var(--cq-font-display);font-size:38px;font-weight:900;color:var(--cq-espresso)}
.cq-sum-msg{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--cq-sage);margin-top:6px;font-style:italic}

.cq-cta-checkout{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;width:100%;padding:18px 40px;background:var(--cq-amber);color:var(--cq-espresso);font-family:var(--cq-font-body);font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-transform:uppercase;border:none;border-radius:60px;cursor:pointer;transition:all var(--cq-transition);text-decoration:none}
.cq-cta-checkout:hover{background:var(--cq-amber-light);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(212,146,11,0.3)}
.cq-cta-checkout svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2.5}

/* Trust */
.cq-trust{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:28px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--cq-border)}
.cq-trust-i{text-align:center;padding:8px}
.cq-trust-ic{width:38px;height:38px;margin:0 auto 10px;background:var(--cq-sage);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.cq-trust-ic svg{width:19px;height:19px;stroke:white;fill:none;stroke-width:2}
.cq-trust-t{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.6px;line-height:1.3}

/* Responsive */
@media(max-width:600px){
  /* v22 - the quiz wrapper extends 120px past the viewport so the
     theme footer stays below the fold, and the container's bottom
     padding rebalances the flex centering so the card still sits at
     the visual middle of the screen. Cards slightly bigger to fill. */
  .cq-quiz-flow{min-height:calc(100vh + 120px)}
  .cq-container{padding-bottom:140px}
  .cq-q-card{padding:34px 20px}
  .cq-opts.cq-g2{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .cq-opts.cq-g3{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr}
  .cq-opt{padding:20px 12px}
  .cq-opt-img-ph{width:72px;height:72px}
  .cq-trust{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:4px;margin-top:20px;padding-top:18px}
  .cq-trust-i{padding:0}
  .cq-trust-ic{width:30px;height:30px;margin-bottom:7px}
  .cq-trust-ic svg{width:15px;height:15px}
  .cq-trust-t{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.2px;line-height:1.25}
  .cq-sum-new{font-size:30px}
  .cq-freq-num{font-size:40px}
  .cq-pr-new{font-size:28px}
  .cq-bag-img-ph{width:70px;height:100px}
  .cq-bag-img{max-width:100px;height:120px}
  .cq-popular{display:none}
  .cq-bag-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}
  .cq-bag-grid .cq-opt{padding:16px 8px 14px}
  .cq-bag-grid .cq-opt-name{font-size:13px !important;white-space:nowrap}
  .cq-bag-grid .cq-opt-desc{font-size:11px}
  .cq-bag-grid .cq-pr-old{font-size:13px}
  .cq-bag-grid .cq-pr-new{font-size:24px}
  .cq-bag-grid .cq-pr-off{font-size:10px}
  /* v9 — keep the free chip legible on mobile; the generic 10px rule
     above would shrink it below the surrounding text. */
  .cq-bag-grid .cq-pr-off.cq-pr-free{font-size:10px;padding:4px 10px;letter-spacing:0.5px}
  .cq-bag-grid .cq-pr-save{font-size:9px;white-space:normal;line-height:1.3}
  .cq-bag-grid .cq-bag-img-ph{width:60px;height:80px}
  .cq-bag-grid .cq-bag-img{max-width:80px;height:100px}
  .cq-ribbon{font-size:7px;padding:3px 10px}
}
@media(max-width:420px){
  .cq-opts.cq-g3{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
}
@media(max-width:360px){
  .cq-trust{gap:3px}
  .cq-trust-t{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0}
}

/* ══════ HIDE DAWN'S CART UI ON THIS PAGE ══════
   Theme is Dawn with cart_type = notification. These are Dawn's real
   element names (from snippets/cart-notification.liquid and
   snippets/cart-drawer.liquid). Scoped to body.cq-hide-cart, which the
   script at the bottom adds, so no other template is affected. */
body.cq-hide-cart cart-notification,
body.cq-hide-cart #cart-notification,
body.cq-hide-cart .cart-notification,
body.cq-hide-cart .cart-notification-wrapper,
body.cq-hide-cart cart-drawer,
body.cq-hide-cart #CartDrawer,
body.cq-hide-cart .cart-drawer,
body.cq-hide-cart .cart-drawer__overlay{
  display:none !important;
  visibility:hidden !important;
  opacity:0 !important;
  pointer-events:none !important;
}
body.cq-hide-cart{overflow:visible !important}

/* Busy state on the checkout button while the cart calls run */
.cq-next.cq-busy{opacity:0.6 !important;pointer-events:none !important}
</style>

<div class="coffee-quiz">

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════
       WARM-UP - press strip, then the Build Your Plan card. Hidden for
       good by cqStart() when Get Started is clicked.
       ══════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="cq-hero-section">

    <!-- Press strip: the existing As Seen On section, verbatim, on white -->
    <section class="as-seen-on">
      <div class="as-seen-on__container page-width">
        <h2 class="as-seen-on__title">RECOMMENDED BY</h2>
        <div class="as-seen-on__logos">
          <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0872/8189/3410/files/press-sacramento-bee.svg?v=1788772371"
               alt="The Sacramento Bee" width="943" height="75" style="--logo-h:28" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0872/8189/3410/files/press-abc10.svg?v=1788772371"
               alt="ABC10" width="301" height="139" style="--logo-h:52" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0872/8189/3410/files/press-comstocks.svg?v=1788773086"
               alt="Comstock's Magazine" width="580" height="69" style="--logo-h:33" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Build Your Plan -->
    <div class="cq-warm">

      <h2 class="cq-warm-heading">{{ section.settings.warmup_heading | default: 'Build Your Plan' }}</h2>

      <div class="cq-warm-grid">
        <div class="cq-warm-img-wrap">
          {% if section.settings.warmup_sticker != blank %}
            <div class="cq-warm-sticker">{{ section.settings.warmup_sticker }}</div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if section.settings.warmup_image != blank %}
            <img class="cq-warm-img" src="{{ section.settings.warmup_image | image_url: width: 500 }}" alt="{{ section.settings.warmup_image.alt | default: "Harvey's Coffee subscription box" }}" loading="eager" width="500" height="500">
          {% else %}
            <div class="cq-warm-img-ph">box photo</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="cq-warm-inc-title">{{ section.settings.warmup_includes_title | default: 'Each Shipment Includes:' }}</div>
          <ul class="cq-warm-inc">
            <li>
              <span class="cq-warm-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.59 13.41l-7.17 7.17a2 2 0 01-2.83 0L2 12V2h10l8.59 8.59a2 2 0 010 2.82z"/><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="1"/></svg></span>
              <span>{{ section.settings.include_1 | default: 'Only single origin, small-batch beans' }}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="cq-warm-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M16 13H8M16 17H8M10 9H8"/></svg></span>
              <span>{{ section.settings.include_2 | default: "A card with tasting notes & the story behind each roast" }}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="cq-warm-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01z"/></svg></span>
              <span>{{ section.settings.include_3 | default: 'Coffee tips & fun facts with every box' }}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="cq-warm-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>
              <span>{{ section.settings.include_4 | default: '100% satisfaction guarantee: love it or your money back' }}</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="cq-warm-cta" onclick="cqStart()">{{ section.settings.warmup_cta | default: 'Get Started' }} <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
      {% if section.settings.warmup_reassure != blank %}
        <div class="cq-warm-reassure">{{ section.settings.warmup_reassure }}</div>
      {% endif %}

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════
       QUIZ FLOW - hidden until Get Started is clicked; cqStart() adds
       cq-active (full-screen, flex-centered) and jumps to the top.
       ══════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div id="cqFlow" class="cq-quiz-flow">

    <div class="cq-progress-bar">
      <div class="cq-prog-seg cq-done" id="cqP1"></div>
      <div class="cq-prog-seg" id="cqP2"></div>
      <div class="cq-prog-seg" id="cqP3"></div>
      <div class="cq-prog-seg" id="cqP4"></div>
      <div class="cq-prog-seg" id="cqP5" style="display:none"></div>
      <div class="cq-prog-text" id="cqPTxt">Step 1 of 4</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cq-container">

      <!-- ══════ Q1: WHOLE BEAN OR GROUND? ══════ -->
      <div class="cq-step cq-active" id="cqS1">
        <div class="cq-q-card">
          <div class="cq-q-title">{{ section.settings.q1_title | default: 'How Do You Brew?' }}</div>
          <div class="cq-q-sub">{{ section.settings.q1_sub | default: ' ' }}</div>
          <div class="cq-opts cq-g2">
            <div class="cq-opt" data-val="whole_bean" onclick="cqPick(this,'brewType')">
              {% if section.settings.img_whole_bean != blank %}
                <img class="cq-opt-img" src="{{ section.settings.img_whole_bean | image_url: width: 200 }}" alt="Whole Bean" loading="lazy" width="200" height="160">
              {% else %}
                <div class="cq-opt-img-ph">image</div>
              {% endif %}
              <div class="cq-opt-name">Whole Bean</div>
              <div class="cq-opt-desc">I grind my own beans</div>
              <div class="cq-dot-wrap"><div class="cq-dot"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="cq-opt" data-val="ground" onclick="cqPick(this,'brewType')">
              {% if section.settings.img_ground != blank %}
                <img class="cq-opt-img" src="{{ section.settings.img_ground | image_url: width: 200 }}" alt="Ground" loading="lazy" width="200" height="160">
              {% else %}
                <div class="cq-opt-img-ph">image</div>
              {% endif %}
              <div class="cq-opt-name">Ground</div>
              <div class="cq-opt-desc">Pre-ground for my brew method</div>
              <div class="cq-dot-wrap"><div class="cq-dot"></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cq-nav">
            <div></div>
            <button class="cq-next" id="cqN1" onclick="cqNext(1)">Next <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ══════ Q1b: GRIND METHOD (only if Ground) ══════ -->
      <div class="cq-step" id="cqS1b">
        <div class="cq-q-card">
          <div class="cq-q-title">Ground Perfectly For Your...</div>
          <div class="cq-q-sub">Select your brew method</div>
          <div class="cq-opts cq-g3">
            {% for block in section.blocks %}
              {% if block.type == 'brew_method' %}
                <div class="cq-opt" data-val="{{ block.settings.brew_value }}" onclick="cqPick(this,'brew')">
                  {% if block.settings.brew_image != blank %}
                    <img class="cq-opt-img" src="{{ block.settings.brew_image | image_url: width: 200 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.brew_label }}" loading="lazy" width="200" height="160">
                  {% else %}
                    <div class="cq-opt-img-ph">image</div>
                  {% endif %}
                  <div class="cq-opt-name">{{ block.settings.brew_label }}</div>
                  <div class="cq-dot-wrap"><div class="cq-dot"></div></div>
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          <div class="cq-nav">
            <button class="cq-back" onclick="cqBack('1b')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg> Back</button>
            <button class="cq-next" id="cqN1b" onclick="cqNext('1b')">Next <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ══════ Q2: ROAST LEVEL ══════ -->
      <div class="cq-step" id="cqS2">
        <div class="cq-q-card">
          <div class="cq-q-title">{{ section.settings.q2_title | default: 'Select Roast Level' }}</div>
          <div class="cq-q-sub">{{ section.settings.q2_sub | default: ' ' }}</div>
          <div class="cq-opts cq-g2">
            {% for block in section.blocks %}
              {% if block.type == 'roast_level' %}
                <div class="cq-opt" data-val="{{ block.settings.roast_value }}" onclick="cqPick(this,'roast')">
                  {% if block.settings.roast_image != blank %}
                    <img class="cq-opt-img" src="{{ block.settings.roast_image | image_url: width: 200 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.roast_label }}" loading="lazy" width="200" height="160">
                  {% else %}
                    <div class="cq-opt-img-ph">image</div>
                  {% endif %}
                  <div class="cq-opt-name">{{ block.settings.roast_label }}</div>
                  <div class="cq-opt-desc">{{ block.settings.roast_desc }}</div>
                  <div class="cq-dot-wrap"><div class="cq-dot"></div></div>
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          <div class="cq-nav">
            <button class="cq-back" onclick="cqBack(2)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg> Back</button>
            <button class="cq-next" id="cqN2" onclick="cqNext(2)">Next <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ══════ Q3: NUMBER OF BAGS ══════ -->
      <div class="cq-step" id="cqS3">
        <div class="cq-q-card">
          <div class="cq-q-title">{{ section.settings.q3_title | default: 'Number of Bags to Ship' }}</div>
          <div class="cq-q-sub">{{ section.settings.q3_sub | default: ' ' }}</div>
          <div class="cq-bag-grid">
            <!-- Double Bag — $32 -> $16 IS one of two bags free. Label says so. -->
            <div class="cq-opt" data-val="two_bags" onclick="cqPick(this,'quantity')">
              <div class="cq-popular">Most Popular</div>
              <div class="cq-ribbon-wrap">
                <div class="cq-ribbon">On Sale Now</div>
                {% if section.settings.img_two_bags != blank %}
                  <img class="cq-bag-img" src="{{ section.settings.img_two_bags | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="Double Bag" loading="lazy" width="300" height="200">
                {% else %}
                  <div class="cq-bag-img-ph"><span>image</span></div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
              <div class="cq-opt-name" >{{ section.settings.label_two_bags | default: 'Double Bag' }}</div>
              <div class="cq-opt-desc">{{ section.settings.desc_two_bags | default: '2 bags · 24oz · ~60 cups' }}</div>
              <div class="cq-price-row">
                <span class="cq-pr-old">${{ section.settings.price_two_bags_original | default: '32' }}</span>
                <span class="cq-pr-new">${{ section.settings.price_two_bags_sale | default: '16' }}</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cq-dot-wrap"><div class="cq-dot"></div></div>
              <div class="cq-pr-off cq-pr-free">{{ section.settings.discount_two_bags | default: '1st Bag FREE' }}</div>
              <div class="cq-pr-save">{{ section.settings.savings_two_bags | default: 'Then $32/shipment · cancel anytime' }}</div>
            </div>
            <!-- Single Bag — deliberately stays a DISCOUNT, not a free bag.
                 If every card says FREE the Double loses its pull, and a
                 free single is $0 revenue against $8.41 COGS. -->
            <div class="cq-opt" data-val="single_bag" onclick="cqPick(this,'quantity')">
              <div class="cq-ribbon-wrap">
                <div class="cq-ribbon">On Sale Now</div>
                {% if section.settings.img_single_bag != blank %}
                  <img class="cq-bag-img" src="{{ section.settings.img_single_bag | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="Single Bag" loading="lazy" width="300" height="200">
                {% else %}
                  <div class="cq-bag-img-ph"><span>image</span></div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
              <div class="cq-opt-name" >{{ section.settings.label_single_bag | default: 'Single Bag' }}</div>
              <div class="cq-opt-desc">{{ section.settings.desc_single_bag | default: '1 bag · 12oz · ~30 cups' }}</div>
              <div class="cq-price-row">
                <span class="cq-pr-old">${{ section.settings.price_single_bag_original | default: '17.50' }}</span>
                <span class="cq-pr-new">${{ section.settings.price_single_bag_sale | default: '8.75' }}</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cq-dot-wrap"><div class="cq-dot"></div></div>
              <div class="cq-pr-off">{{ section.settings.discount_single_bag | default: '50% Off' }}</div>
              <div class="cq-pr-save">{{ section.settings.savings_single_bag | default: 'Then $17.50/shipment · cancel anytime' }}</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Need More -->
          <div class="cq-more-btn" id="cqMoreBtn" onclick="cqToggleMore()">
            Need More? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="cq-more-panel" id="cqMorePanel">
            <div class="cq-bag-grid" style="max-width:280px;margin:0 auto;grid-template-columns:1fr">
              <!-- Triple Bag — $47.50 -> $23.75 is 1.5 of 3 bags free. -->
              <div class="cq-opt" data-val="three_bags" onclick="cqPick(this,'quantity')">
                <div class="cq-ribbon-wrap">
                  <div class="cq-ribbon">On Sale Now</div>
                  {% if section.settings.img_three_bags != blank %}
                    <img class="cq-bag-img" src="{{ section.settings.img_three_bags | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="Triple Bag" loading="lazy" width="300" height="200">
                  {% else %}
                    <div class="cq-bag-img-ph"><span>image</span></div>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>
                <div class="cq-opt-name" >{{ section.settings.label_three_bags | default: 'Triple Bag' }}</div>
                <div class="cq-opt-desc">{{ section.settings.desc_three_bags | default: '3 bags · 36oz · ~90 cups' }}</div>
                <div class="cq-price-row">
                  <span class="cq-pr-old">${{ section.settings.price_three_bags_original | default: '47.50' }}</span>
                  <span class="cq-pr-new">${{ section.settings.price_three_bags_sale | default: '23.75' }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="cq-dot-wrap"><div class="cq-dot"></div></div>
                <div class="cq-pr-off cq-pr-free">{{ section.settings.discount_three_bags | default: '1½ Bags FREE' }}</div>
                <div class="cq-pr-save">{{ section.settings.savings_three_bags | default: 'Then $47.50/shipment · cancel anytime' }}</div>
              </div>
              {% for block in section.blocks %}
                {% if block.type == 'extra_bag' %}
                  <div class="cq-opt" data-val="{{ block.settings.bag_value }}" onclick="cqPick(this,'quantity')">
                    <div class="cq-opt-name">{{ block.settings.bag_label }}</div>
                    <div class="cq-opt-desc">{{ block.settings.bag_desc }}</div>
                    <div class="cq-price-row">
                      <span class="cq-pr-old">${{ block.settings.bag_price_old }}</span>
                      <span class="cq-pr-new">${{ block.settings.bag_price_new }}</span>
                    </div>
                    {% if block.settings.bag_savings != blank %}<div class="cq-pr-save">{{ block.settings.bag_savings }}</div>{% endif %}
                    <div class="cq-dot-wrap"><div class="cq-dot"></div></div>
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="cq-nav">
            <button class="cq-back" onclick="cqBack(3)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg> Back</button>
            <button class="cq-next" id="cqN3" onclick="cqNext(3)">Next <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ══════ Q4: DELIVERY FREQUENCY ══════ -->
      <div class="cq-step" id="cqS4">
        <div class="cq-q-card">
          <div class="cq-q-title">{{ section.settings.q4_title | default: 'Delivery Frequency' }}</div>
          <div class="cq-q-sub">{{ section.settings.q4_sub | default: 'Pause, skip, or change your delivery frequency any time' }}</div>
          <div class="cq-opts cq-g2">
            <div class="cq-freq" data-val="2_weeks" onclick="cqPick(this,'frequency')">
              <div class="cq-freq-ev">Every</div>
              <div class="cq-freq-num">2</div>
              <div class="cq-freq-u">Weeks</div>
              <div class="cq-dot-wrap"><div class="cq-dot"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="cq-freq" data-val="4_weeks" onclick="cqPick(this,'frequency')">
              <div class="cq-freq-ev">Every</div>
              <div class="cq-freq-num">4</div>
              <div class="cq-freq-u">Weeks</div>
              <div class="cq-dot-wrap"><div class="cq-dot"></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cq-trust">
            <div class="cq-trust-i"><div class="cq-trust-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div><div class="cq-trust-t">{{ section.settings.trust1_title | default: 'Satisfaction Guaranteed' }}</div></div>
            <div class="cq-trust-i"><div class="cq-trust-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><div class="cq-trust-t">{{ section.settings.trust2_title | default: 'Skip or Cancel Anytime' }}</div></div>
            <div class="cq-trust-i"><div class="cq-trust-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0118 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div><div class="cq-trust-t">{{ section.settings.trust3_title | default: 'Roasted in Davis, CA' }}</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="cq-nav">
            <button class="cq-back" onclick="cqBack(4)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg> Back</button>
            <button class="cq-next" id="cqN4" onclick="cqCheckout()">{{ section.settings.checkout_text | default: 'Continue to Checkout' }} <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
  var cur=0;
  // ── Pre-populated defaults ──────────────────────────────────────────────
  var S={
    brewType:'whole_bean',
    brew:'whole_bean',
    roast:'medium_dark',
    quantity:'two_bags',
    frequency:'4_weeks'
  };

  function getStepOrder(){
    if(S.brewType==='ground') return ['1','1b','2','3','4'];
    return ['1','2','3','4'];
  }
  function stepIndex(id){return getStepOrder().indexOf(String(id))}
  function nextStep(id){var o=getStepOrder();var i=o.indexOf(String(id));return i>=0&&i<o.length-1?o[i+1]:null}
  function prevStep(id){var o=getStepOrder();var i=o.indexOf(String(id));return i>0?o[i-1]:null}

  var CFG={
    storeDomain:'awa1ji-pb.myshopify.com',
    discountCode:'FIRSTORDER',
    // Shopify SELLING PLAN ids (not selling plan GROUP ids).
    // Verify against Shopify after any Recharge plan edit — recreating a
    // plan in Recharge issues a NEW id and silently orphans the old one.
    sellingPlans:{
      single_bag:{'4_weeks':'27403878434','2_weeks':'27002667042'},
      two_bags:{'4_weeks':'27003519010','2_weeks':'27003551778'},
      three_bags:{'4_weeks':'27003617314','2_weeks':'27003584546'}
    },
    variants:{
      single_bag:{
        light_medium:{whole_bean:'45225479274530',coffee_maker:'45225479307298',french_press:'45225479340066',pour_over:'45225479372834',espresso:'45225479405602',aeropress:'45225479438370',cold_brew:'45225479471138'},
        medium_dark:{whole_bean:'45225479503906',coffee_maker:'45225479536674',french_press:'45225479569442',pour_over:'45225479602210',espresso:'45225479634978',aeropress:'45225479667746',cold_brew:'45225479700514'},
        espresso_roast:{whole_bean:'45225479733282',coffee_maker:'45225479766050',french_press:'45225479798818',pour_over:'45225479831586',espresso:'45225479864354',aeropress:'45225479897122',cold_brew:'45225479929890'},
        decaf:{whole_bean:'45225479962658',coffee_maker:'45225479995426',french_press:'45225480028194',pour_over:'45225480060962',espresso:'45225480093730',aeropress:'45225480126498',cold_brew:'45225480159266'}
      },
      two_bags:{
        light_medium:{whole_bean:'45231045115938',coffee_maker:'45231045148706',french_press:'45231045181474',pour_over:'45231045214242',espresso:'45231045247010',aeropress:'45231045279778',cold_brew:'45231045312546'},
        medium_dark:{whole_bean:'45231045345314',coffee_maker:'45231045378082',french_press:'45231045410850',pour_over:'45231045443618',espresso:'45231045476386',aeropress:'45231045509154',cold_brew:'45231045541922'},
        espresso_roast:{whole_bean:'45231045574690',coffee_maker:'45231045607458',french_press:'45231045640226',pour_over:'45231045672994',espresso:'45231045705762',aeropress:'45231045738530',cold_brew:'45231045771298'},
        decaf:{whole_bean:'45231045804066',coffee_maker:'45231045836834',french_press:'45231045869602',pour_over:'45231045902370',espresso:'45231045935138',aeropress:'45231045967906',cold_brew:'45231046000674'}
      },
      three_bags:{
        light_medium:{whole_bean:'45231117795362',coffee_maker:'45231117828130',french_press:'45231117860898',pour_over:'45231117893666',espresso:'45231117926434',aeropress:'45231117959202',cold_brew:'45231117991970'},
        medium_dark:{whole_bean:'45231118024738',coffee_maker:'45231118057506',french_press:'45231118090274',pour_over:'45231118123042',espresso:'45231118155810',aeropress:'45231118188578',cold_brew:'45231118221346'},
        espresso_roast:{whole_bean:'45231118254114',coffee_maker:'45231118286882',french_press:'45231118319650',pour_over:'45231118352418',espresso:'45231118385186',aeropress:'45231118417954',cold_brew:'45231118450722'},
        decaf:{whole_bean:'45231118483490',coffee_maker:'45231118516258',french_press:'45231118549026',pour_over:'45231118581794',espresso:'45231118614562',aeropress:'45231118647330',cold_brew:'45231118680098'}
      }
    }
  };

  cur=1;

  // ── Apply visual defaults on DOM ready ─────────────────────────────────
  function initDefaults(){
    // Q1: Whole Bean
    var wbOpt=document.querySelector('#cqS1 .cq-opt[data-val="whole_bean"]');
    if(wbOpt) wbOpt.classList.add('cq-on');

    // Q2: Medium Dark (first roast_level block with that value)
    var roastOpt=document.querySelector('#cqS2 .cq-opt[data-val="medium_dark"]');
    if(roastOpt) roastOpt.classList.add('cq-on');

    // Q3: Double Bag — lives in #cqS3, data-val="two_bags"
    var bagOpt=document.querySelector('#cqS3 .cq-opt[data-val="two_bags"]');
    if(bagOpt) bagOpt.classList.add('cq-on');

    // Q4: Every 4 Weeks
    var freqOpt=document.querySelector('#cqS4 .cq-freq[data-val="4_weeks"]');
    if(freqOpt) freqOpt.classList.add('cq-on');

    // Enable all Next buttons since defaults are set
    ['1','2','3','4'].forEach(function(n){
      var btn=document.getElementById('cqN'+n);
      if(btn) btn.classList.add('cq-go');
    });
  }

  // Run after DOM is ready
  if(document.readyState==='loading'){
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',initDefaults);
  }else{
    initDefaults();
  }

  // v17 - center the active question card in the viewport instead of
  // pinning the progress bar to the very top, which left the card
  // sitting high. A card taller than the screen aligns to the top with
  // a little headroom so nothing gets cut off (the bag step on mobile).
  function cqScrollTo(el){
    if(!el)return;
    var r=el.getBoundingClientRect();
    var vh=window.innerHeight||document.documentElement.clientHeight;
    var y;
    if(r.height<vh-48){
      y=window.pageYOffset+r.top-(vh-r.height)/2;
    }else{
      y=window.pageYOffset+r.top-64;
    }
    try{window.scrollTo({top:Math.max(y,0),behavior:'smooth'});}
    catch(e){window.scrollTo(0,Math.max(y,0));}
  }
  function cqScrollToStep(id){
    var s=document.getElementById('cqS'+id);
    var card=s?(s.querySelector('.cq-q-card')||s):null;
    if(!card)return;
    // v22 - mobile: a card that FITS the screen is centered like on
    // desktop; a taller-than-screen card anchors to the progress bar
    // (centering those was the v20 "weird scroll"). Desktop always
    // centers, with cqScrollTo's own tall-card fallback.
    var vw=window.innerWidth||document.documentElement.clientWidth;
    if(vw<=600){
      var vh=window.innerHeight||document.documentElement.clientHeight;
      if(card.getBoundingClientRect().height>=vh-140){
        var bar=document.querySelector('.cq-progress-bar')||card;
        var y=window.pageYOffset+bar.getBoundingClientRect().top-8;
        try{window.scrollTo({top:Math.max(y,0),behavior:'smooth'});}
        catch(e){window.scrollTo(0,Math.max(y,0));}
        return;
      }
    }
    cqScrollTo(card);
  }

  // v18 - warm-up CTA. Clicking it swaps the page: the warm-up is
  // hidden for good, the quiz takes over the full screen (flex-centered
  // by .cq-quiz-flow.cq-active), and we jump to the top.
  window.cqStart=function(){
    var hero=document.querySelector('.cq-hero-section');
    if(hero)hero.style.display='none';
    var f=document.getElementById('cqFlow');
    if(f)f.classList.add('cq-active');
    // v22 - land centered on question one (scrolls the theme header
    // away on mobile so the quiz fills the screen).
    cqScrollToStep(cur);
  };

  window.cqPick=function(el,field){
    if(field==='quantity'){
      document.querySelectorAll('#cqS3 .cq-opt').forEach(function(c){c.classList.remove('cq-on')});
    }else{
      el.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.cq-opt,.cq-freq').forEach(function(c){c.classList.remove('cq-on')});
    }
    el.classList.add('cq-on');
    S[field]=el.getAttribute('data-val');

    if(field==='brewType'){
      if(S.brewType==='whole_bean'){
        S.brew='whole_bean';
      }else{
        S.brew=null;
      }
    }
    enableBtn(cur);
  };

  function enableBtn(s){
    var btn=document.getElementById('cqN'+s);
    if(!btn)return;
    var ok=false;
    switch(String(s)){
      case '1':ok=!!S.brewType;break;
      case '1b':ok=!!S.brew;break;
      case '2':ok=!!S.roast;break;
      case '3':ok=!!S.quantity;break;
      case '4':ok=!!S.frequency;break;
    }
    btn.classList.toggle('cq-go',ok);
  }

  window.cqNext=function(from){
    var btn=document.getElementById('cqN'+from);
    if(!btn||!btn.classList.contains('cq-go'))return;
    var to=nextStep(from);
    if(!to)return;
    go(to,false);
  };
  window.cqBack=function(from){
    var to=prevStep(from);
    if(!to)return;
    go(to,true);
  };

  function go(n,back){
    var old=document.getElementById('cqS'+cur);
    if(old)old.classList.remove('cq-active','cq-back');
    cur=n;
    var nxt=document.getElementById('cqS'+n);
    if(back)nxt.classList.add('cq-back');
    else nxt.classList.remove('cq-back');
    void nxt.offsetWidth;
    nxt.classList.add('cq-active');

    // v18: the warm-up never comes back once the quiz has started, so
    // Back to step 1 keeps the full-screen quiz view.

    var order=getStepOrder();
    var pos=order.indexOf(String(n));
    // v21 - the Ground path has 5 steps; the 5th segment shows only on
    // that path so the bar always matches the "Step x of y" label.
    for(var i=1;i<=5;i++){
      var p=document.getElementById('cqP'+i);
      if(!p)continue;
      p.style.display=(i<=order.length)?'':'none';
      p.classList.toggle('cq-done',i<=pos+1);
    }
    var lbl=document.getElementById('cqPTxt');
    lbl.textContent='Step '+(pos+1)+' of '+order.length;

    cqScrollToStep(n);
    enableBtn(n);
  }

  window.cqToggleMore=function(){
    document.getElementById('cqMoreBtn').classList.toggle('cq-open');
    document.getElementById('cqMorePanel').classList.toggle('cq-show');
  };

  // ── Checkout ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  // Uses /cart/add.js so the selling_plan is bound to the line item by
  // Shopify's cart API. The old cart-permalink approach
  // (/cart/{variant}:1?selling_plan=...) silently discarded the plan and
  // produced one-time orders with no error of any kind.
  function cqRestoreBtn(btn){
    if(btn){
      btn.dataset.busy='';btn.style.pointerEvents='';btn.classList.remove('cq-busy');
      if(btn.dataset.orig){btn.innerHTML=btn.dataset.orig;btn.dataset.orig='';}
    }
  }

  // v15 - cart primer. At page load (and again on bfcache restore) the
  // pristine iframe is built ahead of time and the cart count fetched,
  // so the click skips both the iframe setup and, when the cart is
  // already empty (the common case), the whole /cart/clear.js round
  // trip. null = unknown -> clear runs, the safe default. After coming
  // back from checkout the cart HAS an item, so the pageshow re-prime
  // sees count>0 and the clear correctly runs again.
  var cqCartCount=null;
  function cqPrime(){
    cqCartCount=null;
    try{
      var xf=cqCleanFetch();
      xf(window.location.origin+'/cart.js',{credentials:'same-origin',headers:{'Accept':'application/json'}})
        .then(function(r){return r.json()})
        .then(function(c){cqCartCount=(c&&typeof c.item_count==='number')?c.item_count:null})
        .catch(function(){cqCartCount=null});
    }catch(e){}
  }
  if(document.readyState==='loading'){
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',cqPrime);
  }else{
    cqPrime();
  }

  // Invisible guard, active only between the click and the redirect.
  // Snapshots which fixed/sticky elements are visible at click time; any
  // fixed/sticky element that becomes visible AFTER that (a cart popup,
  // a drawer, an app toast) is hidden. Nothing inside the quiz is touched.
  var cqGuardObs=null, cqGuardSeen=null;
  function cqIsOverlay(el){
    if(!(el instanceof Element)) return false;
    if(el.closest('.coffee-quiz')) return false;
    if(el===document.body||el===document.documentElement) return false;
    var cs=getComputedStyle(el);
    if(cs.position!=='fixed'&&cs.position!=='sticky') return false;
    if(cs.display==='none'||cs.visibility==='hidden') return false;
    var r=el.getBoundingClientRect();
    return r.width>0&&r.height>0;
  }
  function cqGuardStart(){
    cqGuardStop();
    cqGuardSeen=(typeof WeakSet==='function')?new WeakSet():null;
    if(cqGuardSeen){
      var all=document.body.getElementsByTagName('*');
      for(var i=0;i<all.length;i++){ if(cqIsOverlay(all[i])) cqGuardSeen.add(all[i]); }
    }
    if(!window.MutationObserver) return;
    cqGuardObs=new MutationObserver(function(recs){
      for(var i=0;i<recs.length;i++){
        var rec=recs[i], cands=[];
        if(rec.type==='childList'){ for(var j=0;j<rec.addedNodes.length;j++) cands.push(rec.addedNodes[j]); }
        else cands.push(rec.target);
        for(var k=0;k<cands.length;k++){
          var el=cands[k];
          if(!(el instanceof Element)) continue;
          var list=[el]; if(el.querySelectorAll){ var q=el.querySelectorAll('*'); for(var m=0;m<q.length;m++) list.push(q[m]); }
          for(var n=0;n<list.length;n++){
            var e=list[n];
            if(cqGuardSeen&&cqGuardSeen.has(e)) continue;
            if(cqIsOverlay(e)){ e.style.setProperty('display','none','important'); e.style.setProperty('visibility','hidden','important'); }
          }
        }
      }
    });
    cqGuardObs.observe(document.body,{subtree:true,childList:true,attributes:true,attributeFilter:['class','style','open','hidden','aria-hidden']});
  }
  function cqGuardStop(){
    if(cqGuardObs){ cqGuardObs.disconnect(); cqGuardObs=null; }
    cqGuardSeen=null;
  }

  // v14 - unlock the checkout button when the customer comes BACK from
  // checkout. On success the button locks (dataset.busy, cq-busy) and
  // the page navigates away; browsers restore this page from the
  // back-forward cache as a frozen snapshot, so without this the button
  // stayed dead until a hard refresh. pageshow fires on both normal
  // loads (harmless no-op) and bfcache restores (e.persisted).
  window.addEventListener('pageshow',function(){
    cqGuardStop();
    cqRestoreBtn(document.getElementById('cqN4'));
    cqPrime();
  });

  // Pristine fetch from a same-origin iframe. Theme/app scripts that wrap
  // window.fetch or XMLHttpRequest to pop a cart UI on /cart/add.js only
  // patch THIS window; the iframe's realm is untouched.
  function cqCleanFetch(){
    try{
      var f=document.getElementById('cqNetFrame');
      if(!f){
        f=document.createElement('iframe');
        f.id='cqNetFrame';
        f.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
        f.tabIndex=-1;
        f.style.cssText='position:absolute;width:0;height:0;border:0;opacity:0;pointer-events:none';
        document.body.appendChild(f);
      }
      var w=f.contentWindow;
      if(w&&typeof w.fetch==='function'){
        return function(u,o){return w.fetch(u,o)};
      }
    }catch(e){}
    return function(u,o){return window.fetch(u,o)};
  }

  window.cqCheckout=function(){
    var btn=document.getElementById('cqN4');
    if(btn&&(btn.dataset.busy==='1'||!btn.classList.contains('cq-go')))return;

    var productKey=S.quantity||'single_bag';
    var productMap=CFG.variants[productKey];
    var roastMap=productMap?productMap[S.roast]:null;
    var vid=roastMap?roastMap[S.brew]:null;
    var spid=CFG.sellingPlans[productKey]?CFG.sellingPlans[productKey][S.frequency]:null;

    if(!vid){
      alert('Could not find variant for:\nRoast: '+S.roast+'\nBrew: '+S.brew+'\n\nPlease check the variant mapping in coffee-quiz.liquid');
      return;
    }

    // Never fall through to a one-time purchase. If the plan is missing the
    // customer would be charged subscription pricing with nothing recurring.
    if(!spid){
      alert('Subscription plans are temporarily unavailable. Please contact us at harveyuyeyama@gmail.com and we will set this up for you.');
      return;
    }

    if(btn){
      btn.dataset.busy='1';btn.style.pointerEvents='none';btn.classList.add('cq-busy');
      // Instant feedback while the cart calls run; cqRestoreBtn puts the
      // original label back on error or on Back-from-checkout.
      btn.dataset.orig=btn.innerHTML;
      btn.innerHTML='One moment…';
    }

    // Guard goes up BEFORE any cart call is made.
    cqGuardStart();

    var xfetch=cqCleanFetch();
    var origin=window.location.origin;

    function cqAdd(){
      return xfetch(origin+'/cart/add.js',{
        method:'POST',
        credentials:'same-origin',
        headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','Accept':'application/json'},
        body:JSON.stringify({
          items:[{
            id:Number(vid),
            quantity:1,
            selling_plan:Number(spid)
          }]
        })
      });
    }

    // v15 - skip the clear round trip when the primer saw an empty cart.
    // Unknown (null) or non-empty -> clear first, same as before. The
    // cached count is consumed here: a failed attempt leaves an item in
    // the cart, so any retry must clear.
    var cqSkipClear=(cqCartCount===0);
    cqCartCount=null;
    (cqSkipClear
      ? cqAdd()
      : xfetch(origin+'/cart/clear.js',{
          method:'POST',
          credentials:'same-origin',
          headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','Accept':'application/json'}
        }).then(cqAdd)
    )
    .then(function(r){
      return r.json().then(function(d){
        if(!r.ok) throw new Error(d.description||d.message||'Could not add item to cart');
        return d;
      });
    })
    .then(function(d){
      // Confirm the plan actually attached before sending them to checkout.
      var item=d&&d.items&&d.items[0];
      if(item&&!item.selling_plan_allocation){
        throw new Error('Subscription plan did not attach. Please contact us.');
      }
      // Guard stays up — the page is about to navigate away.
      window.location.href = CFG.discountCode
        ? '/discount/'+encodeURIComponent(CFG.discountCode)+'?redirect=%2Fcheckout'
        : '/checkout';
    })
    .catch(function(e){
      cqGuardStop();
      alert('Could not start checkout: '+(e&&e.message?e.message:'unknown error'));
      cqRestoreBtn(btn);
    });
  };
})();
</script>

<script>
/* Adds the body class that scopes the Dawn cart-UI hide above.
   Additive — the quiz script does not depend on it. */
(function(){
  function start(){ document.body.classList.add('cq-hide-cart'); }
  if(document.readyState==='loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',start);
  else start();
})();
</script>

